{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00001",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 5.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Hi, doctor. Long queue outside, but here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.66,
      "end_seconds": 11.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.07,
      "end_seconds": 18.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Um, so... stiffness in the morning. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.58,
      "end_seconds": 21.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "When did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.9,
      "end_seconds": 25.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "For three weeks, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.16,
      "end_seconds": 37.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "Right, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.68,
      "end_seconds": 47.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "It happens once or twice a day. Moderate, really. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.63,
      "end_seconds": 70.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.73,
      "end_seconds": 84.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "almost there.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.5,
      "end_seconds": 113.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 120 over 76, SpO2 99 percent on room air. And temp 36.6 degrees, pulse 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.61,
      "end_seconds": 120.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Is that that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.46,
      "end_seconds": 125.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "okay, we'll put it in context in a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.32,
      "end_seconds": 129.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "shall we do the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.41,
      "end_seconds": 132.11,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.73,
      "end_seconds": 135.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.04,
      "end_seconds": 156.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "There's mild swelling on the right knee, and a grating feel when I bend it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.89,
      "end_seconds": 169.07,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "okay, good, that's the examination any fever, redness over the knee or back pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.23,
      "end_seconds": 172.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.76,
      "end_seconds": 177.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.35,
      "end_seconds": 181.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "no, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.33,
      "end_seconds": 185.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Okay, what do you do for work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.96,
      "end_seconds": 192.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "I work in an office, mostly sitting at a desk"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.57,
      "end_seconds": 197.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Do you get any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.62,
      "end_seconds": 202.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "I walk for about half an hour most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.06,
      "end_seconds": 205.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Are you living with family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.62,
      "end_seconds": 210.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "I stay with my daughter and her family."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.04,
      "end_seconds": 215.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.55,
      "end_seconds": 218.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.03,
      "end_seconds": 222.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "right, any surgery in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.15,
      "end_seconds": 228.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Just a hernia repair, about five years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.2,
      "end_seconds": 242.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.43,
      "end_seconds": 249.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.25,
      "end_seconds": 269.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? I think we're dealing with osteoarthritis of the knees at this stage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.15,
      "end_seconds": 280.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.64,
      "end_seconds": 282.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "okay, noted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.8,
      "end_seconds": 302.1,
      "duration_seconds": 17.3,
      "text": "Let's use etoricoxib, 60 milligrams, once a day, for five days. It's for knee pain. Losing even a few kilos takes a lot of load off the knees, and I'd like you to do the strengthening exercises. I'll also refer you to physiotherapy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.85,
      "end_seconds": 303.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.59,
      "end_seconds": 314.23,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.36,
      "end_seconds": 317.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "okay, I'll remember"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.97,
      "end_seconds": 321.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "That's it on my side. Anything unclear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.1,
      "end_seconds": 325.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "thanks, that was helpful"
    }
  ]
}